==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]], [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]], [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]], [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]], [[Occultist Cat (Special Cat)|Occultist Cat]] and [[Principal Cat (Special Cat)|Principal Cat]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*6 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Your options here are severely limited, but this stage's pushing power is not the greatest. Fill the top row with Attack Buff [[Cat Combo]]s and/or Research Cat Combos. [[Occultist Cat (Special Cat)|Gyaru Cat]] should be your main DPS, given she targets the Ginger Snaches and Doge Darks for Massive Damage. [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Punk Cat]] and [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Stealth Class Rep Cat]] ward off the frontline well enough until all of the major threats are wiped out. Beyond that point, use [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Girlfriend Cat]] to slowly chip away at THE SLOTHS and eventually claim your victory.

